<p dir=3D"auto">Markdown is extremely close to plain text, with minimal mar=
kup or formatting, but still
provides a way to represent important document structure. Mainstream LLMs, =
such as
OpenAI's GPT-4o, natively "<em>speak</em>" Markdown, and often incorporate =
Markdown into their
responses unprompted. This suggests that they have been trained on vast amo=
unts of
Markdown-formatted text, and understand it well. As a side benefit, Markdow=
n conventions
are also highly token-efficient.</p>
