<p dir=3D"auto">MarkItDown has optional dependencies for activating various=
 file formats. Earlier in this document, we installed all optional dependen=
cies with the <code>[all]</code> option. However, you can also install them=
 individually for more control. For example:</p>
<div class=3D"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relativ=
e overflow-auto" dir=3D"auto"><pre>pip install <span class=3D"pl-s"><span c=
lass=3D"pl-pds">'</span>markitdown[pdf, docx, pptx]<span class=3D"pl-pds">'=
